# The SimpleSAMLphp service provider of the judge of sub-spike 9c (issue #732), imported by the Caddy of the op
# container of compose.yaml and by no image: a site of the development stack, served under the certificate of
# the stack like op.localhost (STACK_HOSTS in .castor/stack/stack.php), and passed to the "saml-sp" service,
# which "castor saml-sp" starts. Caddy dials that service at each request, so nothing here waits for it:
# saml-sp.localhost answers 502 while it is not running.
saml-sp.localhost {
	reverse_proxy saml-sp:80
}
